{"run_id": "485a4ed0c7a242dab98ef08900a2fa5a", "sequence": 4, "time": "2026-10-29T16:40:18.039665+00:00", "event": "tool_result", "call_id": "n02-1-0", "name": "search_documents", "observation": {"ok": true, "mode": "hybrid", "hits": [{"doc_id": "D03", "version_date": "2026-02-01", "chunk_id": "c002", "title": "年假申请流程", "topic": "年假", "scope": "全体正式员工", "status": "有效", "parent_id": "r002", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["年假申请流程", "正文"], "token_count": 59, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D03-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/markdown/D03_年假申请流程.md", "sha256": "041edf691e47cbcdc69171f784c112374b5b1f13fb3cb87501fd6c1b0c7e36be", "method": "markdown", "page": null, "bbox": null, "line_start": 15, "line_end": 15, "confidence": null}], "snippet": "紧急请假可先联系主管，再于返岗后1个工作日内补交申请。本文不规定年假天数。", "rrf_score": 0.032787, "bm25_score": 5.870818, "vector_score": 0.604897}, {"doc_id": "D05", "version_date": "2026-01-01", "chunk_id": "c014", "title": "办公网络接入指南", "topic": "VPN", "scope": "全体员工", "status": "有效", "parent_id": "r014", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["办公网络接入指南", "第十四节 沟通与状态确认"], "token_count": 234, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 4, "bbox": [48.0, 340.6171875, 180.25, 352.1171875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 4, "bbox": [48.0, 367.4765625, 541.5, 412.9765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 4, "bbox": [48.0, 428.9765625, 541.5, 456.9765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}], "snippet": "第十四节 沟通与状态确认\n\n服务台可能要求补充可公开给处理人员的错误信息。申请人应通过原工单补充，保留处理记录，避免多个渠道出现相互矛盾的描述。恢复后可以记录恢复时间及最后一次操作，但没有验证因果关系时，不应断言某项操作必然解决问题。\n\n问题已受理、处理中和已恢复是不同状态。本文没有承诺服务台响应时限、故障恢复时间或补偿规则。需要紧急访问时，应请求业务负责人", "rrf_score": 0.030077, "bm25_score": 2.749288, "vector_score": 0.485992}, {"doc_id": "D03", "version_date": "2026-02-01", "chunk_id": "c001", "title": "年假申请流程", "topic": "年假", "scope": "全体正式员工", "status": "有效", "parent_id": "r001", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["年假申请流程", "正文"], "token_count": 60, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D03-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/markdown/D03_年假申请流程.md", "sha256": "041edf691e47cbcdc69171f784c112374b5b1f13fb3cb87501fd6c1b0c7e36be", "method": "markdown", "page": null, "bbox": null, "line_start": 13, "line_end": 13, "confidence": null}], "snippet": "正式员工申请年假，应至少提前3个工作日在办公系统提交申请，并由直属主管审批。", "rrf_score": 0.029877, "bm25_score": 1.344515, "vector_score": 0.496981}, {"doc_id": "D02", "version_date": "2026-03-01", "chunk_id": "c013", "title": "费用报销制度乙", "topic": "报销期限", "scope": "未说明", "status": "未说明", "parent_id": "r013", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["费用报销制度乙", "第十三条期限问答"], "token_count": 223, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D02-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_scanned/D02_费用报销制度乙_模拟扫描.pdf", "sha256": "545aa231842caf089edb81acf5afb59034f885fca9c050d28d312c53f0902bd2", "method": "ocr", "page": 4, "bbox": [49.49232788085938, 184.18751220703126, 146.36192626953124, 195.64617919921875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": 0.9986509010195732}, {"file_id": "D02-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_scanned/D02_费用报销制度乙_模拟扫描.pdf", "sha256": "545aa231842caf089edb81acf5afb59034f885fca9c050d28d312c53f0902bd2", "method": "ocr", "page": 4, "bbox": [49.49232788085938, 210.9244140625, 541.454541015625, 256.75908203125], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": 0.9981319904327393}, {"file_id": "D02-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_scanned/D02_费用报销制度乙_模拟扫描.pdf", "sha256": "545aa231842caf089edb81acf5afb59034f885fca9c050d28d312c53f0902bd2", "method": "ocr", "page": 4, "bbox": [49.49232788085938, 272.0373046875, 536.801416015625, 302.1693603515625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": 0.9984620551805239}], "snippet": "第十三条期限问答\n\n问：十五天是工作日吗？答：本文写的是15个自然日，包含周末与节假日。问：财务需要在15天内付款吗？答：15天是申请提交期限，本文没有规定付款时限。问：补开发票后期限重新开始吗？答：本文没有这一规定，不能自动重新起算。\n\n问：超过15天是否绝对不能报？答：本文没有规定超期处置、豁免条件和批准权限，不能推导出绝对结论。问：本制度是否只适用于某", "rrf_score": 0.029762, "bm25_score": 3.653751, "vector_score": 0.460959}, {"doc_id": "D04", "version_date": "2026-02-01", "chunk_id": "c003", "title": "出差住宿规则", "topic": "住宿", "scope": "国内出差", "status": "有效", "parent_id": "r003", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["出差住宿规则", "第三条 预订前核对"], "token_count": 230, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D04-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D04_出差住宿规则_跨页表格.pdf", "sha256": "c9384bbeeca21f469c6efc510eee893d76d2fff002f0e681c5bfeeb28a2a97d6", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 1, "bbox": [48.0, 444.1171875, 145.75, 455.6171875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D04-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D04_出差住宿规则_跨页表格.pdf", "sha256": "c9384bbeeca21f469c6efc510eee893d76d2fff002f0e681c5bfeeb28a2a97d6", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 1, "bbox": [48.0, 470.9765625, 541.5, 516.4765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D04-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D04_出差住宿规则_跨页表格.pdf", "sha256": "c9384bbeeca21f469c6efc510eee893d76d2fff002f0e681c5bfeeb28a2a97d6", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 1, "bbox": [48.0, 532.4765625, 541.5, 577.9765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}], "snippet": "第三条 预订前核对\n\n预订前应核对出差目的地、入住和离店日期、房间费用明细及是否存在个人延住。会议价、节假日价和会展期间涨价都不自动提高制度限额。需要超标时，应在预订前取得相应书面批准，并保存批准对应的日期和费用事项。\n\n多人同行、合住和连住多个城市时，应分别说明实际入住人员与城市，不得将某一城市的较高限额套用于整个行程。合住费用如何分摊、套餐如何拆分等事项", "rrf_score": 0.016129, "bm25_score": 4.495769, "vector_score": 0.402594}, {"doc_id": "D02", "version_date": "2026-03-01", "chunk_id": "c012", "title": "费用报销制度乙", "topic": "报销期限", "scope": "未说明", "status": "未说明", "parent_id": "r012", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["费用报销制度乙", "第十二条缺失材料与疑难事项"], "token_count": 142, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D02-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_scanned/D02_费用报销制度乙_模拟扫描.pdf", "sha256": "545aa231842caf089edb81acf5afb59034f885fca9c050d28d312c53f0902bd2", "method": "ocr", "page": 3, "bbox": [49.06931762695312, 566.1431640625, 203.89146728515624, 578.026220703125], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": 0.9946264074398921}, {"file_id": "D02-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_scanned/D02_费用报销制度乙_模拟扫描.pdf", "sha256": "545aa231842caf089edb81acf5afb59034f885fca9c050d28d312c53f0902bd2", "method": "ocr", "page": 3, "bbox": [49.06931762695312, 591.182470703125, 541.8775390625, 639.563525390625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": 0.9991453140974045}], "snippet": "第十二条缺失材料与疑难事项\n\n发票遗失、供应方无法补开、支付记录无法调取等情况，应如实说明，不能伪造凭证。本文没有授权任何固定角色免除发票要求，也没有规定说明书等同于可报凭证。审核人员应列明缺口，并请求补充制度或正式授权材料。", "rrf_score": 0.016129, "bm25_score": 0.0, "vector_score": 0.510236}]}}
